Dear Ms Fenlow,

Thank you for your reply about the kitchen ceiling leak at 16 Brindlewick Mews. I have noted that you authorise the quoted plumbing work (isolating the pipe, opening about 30 cm of ceiling lining, replacing the joint and making the opening safe) up to the estimate amount, provided it is carried out safely, and that you want to be contacted before any increase in scope or cost.

The contractor's estimate did not state a total or whether VAT is included, and it excludes investigation, testing, removal and disposal of any suspect material. I have asked him to confirm the complete total, VAT, whether making good is included, his earliest date, and what that exclusion refers to. I will not instruct him to start until I have those answers, and I will come back to you straight away if the figure or scope differs from what you have authorised.

Kind regards,
